==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|judgment day||US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|Christianity|Islam|Judaism}} The [[Last Judgment]], Final Judgment, final trial of all humankind, both the living and dead by [[God]] expected to take place at the end of the world, when each is rewarded or punished according to his or her merits.
#* {{quote-song|en|title=In the Year 2525|author={{w|Zager and Evans}}|year=1968|passage=If God's a-coming, he ought to make it by then / Maybe he'll look around himself and say / “Guess it's time for the '''judgement day'''!”}}

